Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:06:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Progressive rev limiter (pro-style spark cut ramp)

When enabled, spark cut ramps linearly from the start cut % to 100%
inside a window below the RPM limit (constant or CLT based), through the
hard spark limiter. The existing hard cut at the limit is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
